[{"type":"message","user":"U01TL444GL8","text":"\u003c@U01TL444GL8\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1617168780.024900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e6f4441a-f935-4679-a954-0580f17ff7dc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"混乱ですねぇ。。個人アカウントをorgにjoinさせる、というのがシンプルで良い気もしますが。。\n(というかGitHubに複数アカウントをサポートするUIがないので、単に使い辛くなる。。\n 今はchromeとfirefoxで個人アカウントと法人orgに所属してる無料アカウントを使い分けてます。酷い。。)","ts":"1617164934.024300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":4,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U81LLJ340","U8CC7MDCL","U012MBD7MFZ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nI7Ee"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1aa8dbf-b064-41c8-a493-acdb4bcb6313","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"個人垢で、現場のorgにjoinして仕事している","ts":"1617162211.023800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p2PHL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ecee7e0a-6532-4051-9653-7cd1f8bad58b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"docker内で開発してる人とかだと混ざりやすい認識ですね。このコンテナはプライベート用には使わないと思ってても不意にdotfiles更新してしまったりとかで","ts":"1617161193.023300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ptu/g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"068d9f09-6037-4f8a-a115-3ba164ff548f","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"\u003chttp://github.com/hoge/fuga|github.com/hoge/fuga\u003e というリポジトリを `~/dev/git/com/github/hoge/fuga` に入れるようにしていて、かつ `gitconfig` の `includeif` で使用する SSH コマンドと `user.name` / `user.email` を完全に分離しているので、混ざったことがない","ts":"1617161080.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cxYP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05541e11-5eb3-482c-a098-e6616b0a6cbd","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"２つあると事故りますしね。プライベート用の方に会社アカウントでコミットしてたやつが入ってしまってforce pushとか","ts":"1617160732.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7wbyk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ec202c9-7764-423e-a5aa-58f3ba1563b9","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"仕事もプライベートも同じアカウントで特に何も困ってないのでこのままで行く予定\n確かにSAMLとかでOrgの認証してるところは別途用意したほうが良いのかも","ts":"1617160609.019700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rYDD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40113511-8df2-48c9-b402-98e2dff0adae","type":"message","user":"UBRTB4N5C","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/en/github/site-policy/github-terms-of-service#b-account-terms\u003e をみると(machine accounts ではない)普通の無料アカウントは1個だけしかダメのまま変わっていないようにみえるけどなあ。","ts":"1617156645.019600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VH80f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d927cc0e-81bd-4675-87c7-6dfedf3255ab","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"Enterpriseですらダメだったんなら、有料Organizationに属するだけでOKなんて論理はそうそうありえない話ですよねェ。","ts":"1617152390.017900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mtWKF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68d91830-bcbd-4ef5-9ad5-addc3c31ae5b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ikeike443/status/1377059444425596928\u003e","ts":"1617152186.017700","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ikeike443|@ikeike443\u003e: Enterpriseのお客さんから、アカウントを分けたいって話は世界中で山のようにもらってたし、実際いくつかの国で問題にもなってたので、ここを解消する方向に舵を切るんだと思いますよ。AEとかもそのひとつかなと。","id":1,"author_name":"Takafumi Ikeda","author_subname":"@ikeike443","author_link":"https://twitter.com/ikeike443/status/1377059444425596928","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/577475048245592064/3sN4WtYC_normal.jpeg","text":"Enterpriseのお客さんから、アカウントを分けたいって話は世界中で山のようにもらってたし、実際いくつかの国で問題にもなってたので、ここを解消する方向に舵を切るんだと思いますよ。AEとかもそのひとつかなと。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1617151530,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/ikeike443/status/1377059444425596928","original_url":"https://twitter.com/ikeike443/status/1377059444425596928"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ii=b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"05f2c00c-9d49-4437-8c18-01a93940b86f","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ふーむ…やはりわからんですな","ts":"1617152063.017500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fvd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5be92583-08a7-48a8-b055-f97270a80edf","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"2つ目のアカウントが有料orgに属する事を表明する必要があるのかな。","ts":"1617151998.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J=yh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"932e042a-3b03-4932-9af8-3a1078e27513","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"そんなら僕も分けようかな…仕事用Macでプライベートアカウント使う理由もはやないし…","ts":"1617151916.016800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mn5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8da0280c-fbf8-4c94-872e-c5aefec0e2bf","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"ふーむ。単に有料organizationのメンバーならそいつはもう有料アカウントとみなされるということですかね。どうやら。","ts":"1617151777.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nQX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03b5de28-a575-471c-a1c6-01b2a61221ea","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ikeike443/status/1377041685205504000\u003e","ts":"1617147892.016500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/ikeike443|@ikeike443\u003e: \u003chttps://twitter.com/mattn_jp|@mattn_jp\u003e \u003chttps://twitter.com/unagix|@unagix\u003e 僕は